 "build": {
  "id": "949f4b0d-97ef-43c2-af96-fb29de54d81e",
  "title": "KOX - AoE",
  "description": "[overview]\nCan change 1 rank of invasion for either + one of Infernal Pursuit or + one Shadowflame Forge.\n\n[rotation]\nMelt with 6 Demonfire -> Skulltaker with 6 Demonfire (to increase Hellmaw tickrate) -> Demon Heart -> Hellmaw with 6 Demonfire -> pop burst (Hellfire Form + Blood Fury if orc + Burning rage) -> then spam Seeking flame and alternate with annihilation.\n\nI advise you to create a macro for annihilation because it's a little bugged.\n\nI use this ones:\n\n#showtooltip Infernal Strike\n/cast Annihilation\n/cast Infernal Strike\n\n#showtooltip Seeking flame\n/cast Annihilation\n/cast Seeking flame",
